(first forged the ward pillars that keep Hush safe. She almost died doing it. Then her) Tj
T*
(antennae perk in a disconcerting way. "This is good. Stop, here. Now come help me. I'm) Tj
T*
(old." She begins to glow. "I'll need an hour. Enjoy the night air while you can. We'll) Tj
T*
(be very busy soon.") Tj
